 /**
  * Refunds part or all of a paid order.
  * Contract: docs/architecture/api.md ("POST /api/orders/:orderId/refund").
+ * Accounting rules: ADR-005. Follows the same conventions as PaymentService.pay
+ * (ADR-001 paise, ADR-002 v2 provider, ADR-003 idempotency, ADR-004 errors).
